    <Description>This is a Macro for Hypixel Skyblock Garden or on your Private Island [ If you're still farming on your Private Island (for some reason) ]

and This is a Second Verison of my Hypixel Skyblock Garden Farming Macro cause the First one had some inconsistency and kinda slow and i didn't reallly like it, i just wanted to sit in bed or on my chair and play some mobile games or farm while i'm working out and stuff.

Impotant Things to Do for the (end of the) Macro (to work properly):
1 ) Download Skytils if you don't have Skytils
2 ) Do /st and "Add Alias" and add An Alias
3 ) Replace 'Alias Name' to 'gd' and 'Executed Command' to 'warp garden

And Garden Plot Size/Design:
1 ) The Plot Length: 1x5 Plots
And if you want to copy my farm: imgur(dot)com/a/VHhaQjz

Now How to Setup Up The Macro:
1 ) The Rancher's Boots Speed Cap: 93
2 ) The Rotational Yaw Axis: 90, 180, -90, -180
3 ) And Set/Change the Attack Button to The Space Bar

And Contact Me, Comment on the post if you have any questions about the macro and stuff and don't get caught haha</Description>
